<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu group net profit seen falling in 96/97.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu group net profit seen falling in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd's group net profit for the year to March 31, 1997, is expected to fall 13-21 percent from a year ago to 50-55 billion yen, a Japanese business newspaper said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Nihon Keizai Shimbun said it based its estimate on expected poor performance at Fujitsu's semiconductor subsidiaries and a half-year net loss at Amdahl Corp of the United States, in which Fujitsu has a 43 percent stake.</p>
<p>Fujitsu officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
